; hledger / ledger-cli both accept YYYY/MM/DD dates. This is the
; canonical example from hledger.org/journal.html:
;
;     2008/01/01 income
;         assets:bank:checking   $1
;         income:salary         $-1
;
; Note: hledger uses lowercase top-level account names by convention but
; both cases are valid; we use Title-cased here to match the rest of our
; test corpus and our InferAccountType heuristic.

account Assets:Bank:Checking
account Income:Salary

2008/01/01 * income
    Assets:Bank:Checking          $1.00
    Income:Salary                -$1.00

2008/01/15 * payroll
    Assets:Bank:Checking          $1.00
    Income:Salary                -$1.00
